  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "NEW\n\t\t\t* Within tables what each project may reference and use, under its test in the specification\n\t\t\t* SourceProject.Reaches: what a project depends on, directly or through other projects\n\t\t\tCHANGED\n\t\t\t* Source.Projects names projects under the root its spec project's name shares\n\t\t\tFIXED\n\t\t\t* A failing Has().All or Has().None states its condition and lists only the items that break it\n\t\t\t* Has().None reads \"has none\", not \"has not some\", in failures and in the specification\n\t\t\t* Within reads \"is within what is allowed\", not \"is within\", in the specification\n\t\t\tOBSOLETE\n\t\t\t* Under(root): the root is the one the spec project's name shares with the projects",
